{"blocks":[["Launchpad/","source-block-200","Launchpad/UG",["Novation/Launchpad/Pro/Mk3"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-80","Launchpad Pro User Guide",[]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-109","User guide for the Launchpad, the Novation Launchpad Pro Mk3 grid controller.",["Launchpad Pro User Guide"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-194","Chapters",["Launchpad Pro User Guide"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-209","Launchpad/UG/01 Introduction",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-246","Launchpad/UG/02 Getting Up and Running",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-293","Launchpad/UG/03 Hardware Overview",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-335","Launchpad/UG/04 Launchpad Pro Interface",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-383","Launchpad/UG/05 Session Mode",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-420","Launchpad/UG/06 Note Mode",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-454","Launchpad/UG/07 Chord Mode",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-489","Launchpad/UG/08 Custom Modes",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-526","Launchpad/UG/09 Sequencer",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-560","Launchpad/UG/10 Setup",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/","source-block-590","Launchpad/UG/11 Appendix",["Launchpad Pro User Guide","Chapters"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/","source-block-170","1. Introduction",[]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/","source-block-190","Launchpad Pro is a grid controller for producing and performing with Ableton Live or external MIDI hardware.",["1. Introduction"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/","source-block-302","Its 64 velocity- and pressure-sensitive RGB pads can launch clips, play notes, and sequence steps. The four-track, 32-step sequencer provides probability and mutation controls for evolving patterns.",["1. Introduction"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/","source-block-504","Eight Custom Modes can send MIDI to software or hardware. The two MIDI output ports extend control to external instruments.",["1. Introduction"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/","source-block-631","The unit can operate without a computer when powered through its USB-C port by the included wall adapter.",["1. Introduction"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-162","1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features",[]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-197","Ableton Live integration: play, record, and produce from the controller.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-277","Pads: 64 RGB pads sense velocity and pressure.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-331","Sequencer: four tracks with 32-step patterns, scenes, probability, and mutation.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-419","Chord Mode: explore, build, save, and play chords from the grid.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-491","Note and Scale Modes: play melodies and chords in key; Drum Mode maps a drum rack to the grid.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-593","MIDI connections: MIDI In, Out 1, and Out 2/Thru connect external equipment.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/01%20Key%20Features/","source-block-677","Custom Modes: eight editable MIDI layouts made with Novation Components.",["1.1 Launchpad Pro Key Features"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/02%20In%20the%20Box/","source-block-164","1.2 In the Box",[]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/02%20In%20the%20Box/","source-block-183","Launchpad Pro",["1.2 In the Box"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/02%20In%20the%20Box/","source-block-200","USB-C to USB-A cable",["1.2 In the Box"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/02%20In%20the%20Box/","source-block-224","USB-C to USB-C cable",["1.2 In the Box"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/02%20In%20the%20Box/","source-block-248","USB-A power adapter",["1.2 In the Box"]],["Launchpad/UG/01%20Introduction/02%20In%20the%20Box/","source-block-271","Three TRS minijack-to-DIN MIDI adapters",["1.2 In the Box"]],["Launchpad/UG/02%20Getting%20Up%20and%20Running/","source-block-203","2. Getting Up and Running",[]]],"format_version":5}